%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: PetreFullMutantDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: You know what happened to my dog.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: He came back through this checkpoint and he came back wrong. Something
      in this place touched him. Something on your side of the glass.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I was never a talented man. I always said that. The poems weren't mine.
      The sermons weren't mine. He moved through me. I was the pen. Only ever the pen.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: SuspectFaceCam
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: But a pen doesn't grieve. And I have been grieving. Very specifically.
      For weeks now.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: He speaks through me more completely now. I can feel the whole weight
      of it. The vessel doesn't get smaller. Everything else does.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Petre, step away from the window.
      npcResponse: In a moment. I am in the middle of something. He is. We are.
      animationTrigger: TalkCocky
    - playerChoiceText: Your dog is alive. I've seen him.
      npcResponse: You've seen what he is now. That is not what he was. You did that.
        This place did that.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I have been very patient with this grief. I am not patient anymore.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: The next line is His. Not mine. I want you to understand that distinction
      before it arrives.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: SuspectFaceCam
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
